1	Query_1	Non-specific	516188	42	670	2.87173e-124	380.415	pfam04348	LppC	-	-
1	Query_1	Specific	380562	258	667	7.97852e-75	244.102	cd06339	PBP1_YraM_LppC_lipoprotein-like	-	530412
ENDDOMAINS
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	putative ligand binding site	L387,L388,K389,N408,Q409,L454,T543,S570	8	8	380562
ENDSITES
MOTIFS
1	Query_1	TPR repeat	Q66	92E	0
1	Query_1	TPR repeat	R99	127P	0
ENDMOTIFS
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	153	NP_418053.1 tetratricopeptide-like domain-containing protein YibG [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
DOMAINS
